WEBVTT

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:05.230
I've finally scored
some limited-edition pudding!

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:08.400
You really love pudding, don't you.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.820
I just can't get enough of it!

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:14.110
Why, I'd do <i>anything</i> for pudding!

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.200
Nagisa?

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:23.040
"The Taka Gang of Thieves"

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:26.170
"The Taka Gang Ringleader:
Takaoka the Merciless"

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:26.420
--The girl's mine!
--Wrong gender!

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:28.210
No! But how?

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:31.010
If you want her back,
I'll trade for the Big Bad!

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:33.220
Bring the Big Bad to Fukuma Tower!

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.300
You coward! We do this <i>now</i>!

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:36.300
Kayano...!

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:39.560
--I want my limited-edition pudding back!
--What, the <i>pudding</i>?!

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:40.100
Hm!

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:56.240
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:05.660
"Nagisa"

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:07.330
"Karma"

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:08.330
"Kaede"

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:09.670
"Isogai" "Maehara"

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:12.340
"Rio" "Okuda" "Sugino" "Kanzaki"

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:13.840
"Itona" "Ritsu"

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:15.340
"Chiba" "Hayami" "Hinata" "Meg"

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:17.840
"Hinano" "Takebayashi" "Toka" "Justice"

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:19.850
"Muramatsu" "Kirara" "Yoshida" "Terasaka"

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:21.850
"Okajima" "Hara" "Mimura" "Fuwa" "Sugaya"

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:23.850
"Karasuma" "Irina"

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:40.160
"Showdown at Fukuma Tower!"

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:42.660
Well!

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:45.750
And so, Nagisa has been abducted.

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:48.330
Eh? Isn't that... serious?

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:51.500
I'm the Big Bad--this kind of thing
happens all the time.

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:52.920
Ah.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:58.510
I'll use analysis magic to put together
the optimal rescue party!

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:00.720
Wow! You can do that?

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:04.100
That's the Evolved Mage for you.
What an asset!

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:08.310
What's that sound?

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:11.150
Analysis complete!

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:12.730
Eh? Magic...?

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:14.780
--Magic!
--Yeah, but that's a fax--

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:15.820
--It's magic!
--Yeah, but that's a fax--

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:17.440
Well, see, the thing is...

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:20.160
I'm telling you, it's <i>magic</i>.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:25.330
--There's something there! Something there!
--Black magic! Black magic!

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:27.960
This will be our rescue party:

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:28.710
"Isogai"

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:29.460
"Maehara"

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:30.210
"Okajima"

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:30.960
"Rio" "Fuwa" "Kaede"

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:31.920
"Karma" "Itona"

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:35.880
We <i>will</i> pull off this rescue...

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.050
...and get that limited-edition pudding!

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:38.380
What, the <i>pudding</i>?!

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:45.010
"Physical Comedy for Dummies:
Funny Ways to Get Into Hot Water"

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:41.470
See, when it comes to rescuing Nagisa,

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:44.220
I could do it myself, no problem.

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:45.970
He dodged it!

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:47.100
Nice shot!

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:48.310
Karma!

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:51.150
A whole new pattern! Leave it to Karma!

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:53.940
You two are a real handful, as always.

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:55.940
"Fukuma Tower"

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:59.490
So that's Fukuma Tower...

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:02.200
We'll get you out of there. Hold tight, pu...

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:02.780
...Nagisa!

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:04.830
You totally said "pu"!

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:08.410
What's with all the washtubs?

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:10.580
I've been waiting forever!

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:11.210
Who's there?!

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:13.380
What took you so long?

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:14.460
--<i>You</i>?!
--<i>You</i>?!

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:17.760
--Master!
--<i>You</i> be quiet!

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:20.220
Huh? That's right--where's Koro Sensei?

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.630
Right here, Nakamura!

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:25.350
What the heck is <i>that</i>?!

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:28.560
"Half-Off Sale: Orbs of Sealing"

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:28.640
--I picked up a rare item at a local shop
--Just a little cheaper! Just a little!

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:31.230
--and had myself sealed away
--Excuse me, but could you seal me away?

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:33.480
--to make the hostage exchange easier.
--Excuse me, but could you seal me away?

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:40.940
"The Big Bad was sealed away!"

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:40.570
You don't get to seal <i>yourself</i> away!

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:45.030
I bet we can totally beat him in this form!

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:52.830
"Does 0 points of damage to the Big Bad!"

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:59.250
In exchange for a speed of zero,
my defense is now 99,999!

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:02.050
"DEF: 99999"

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:01.920
So the seal's totally pointless...

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:04.510
"Fukuma Tower, 2nd Floor"

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:08.100
Okay, gang--let's hurry.

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:09.560
Not so fast.

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:10.600
Who's there?!

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:14.310
I am one of the Fukuma Triple Threat:

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:15.980
Smog the Noxious!

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:18.690
"The Taka Gang's Fukuma Triple Threat:
Smog the Noxious"

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:18.820
I'm afraid this is as far
as your fate will take you.

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:20.820
Dammit--an ambush!

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:22.780
<i>I'll</i> handle this.

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:24.200
Fuwa?

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.950
And just what can <i>you</i> do, Miss Helmet-Head?

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:31.370
You seem not to know, so why don't I tell you:

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:34.210
the <i>truth</i> about this world!

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:36.500
Seems Smog's been taken down.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:39.550
Hm. A disgrace to the Fukuma Triple Threat.

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:43.590
He always <i>was</i> the weakest of us three.

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:45.880
In a trio like this, the first one out

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:48.600
can <i>never</i> win against <i>anyone</i>!

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:54.230
She... won, somehow.

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:56.190
"Fukuma Tower, 3rd Floor"

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:58.150
Hm.

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:59.150
"The Taka Gang's Fukuma Triple Threat:
Grip the Crusher"

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:04.030
Huh! This guy looks like a pushover.

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:06.070
Let <i>me</i> take him on.

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:08.570
Karma's not getting hit by any washtubs!

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:10.950
Does that mean this guy can't be belittled?

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:15.500
It's all right. See? Karma's chin is down.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:19.290
He's not looking down on his foe,
but rather concentrating.

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:22.130
The way he is now, he should be able to win.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:26.430
So you recognize my strength, hm.

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:29.260
I congratulate you for making it this far, hm.

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:32.350
As a parting gift, I'll tell you my name, hm:

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:36.890
I am Grip the Crusher
of the Fukuma Triple Threat, hm.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:40.360
With my grip strength,
there's nothing I can't crush, hm.

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:44.030
I'll crush <i>you</i>, and you'll die right here, hm!

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:45.740
"Hm"?

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:47.610
Say, mister...

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:49.570
You sure say "hm" a lot!

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:49.570
"Luck: -258"

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:50.620
Hm! Hm!

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:52.200
Nice shot!

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.450
Karma!

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.500
Defeating the enemy with his own bug?!

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:57.580
You're enjoying this a little too much!

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:59.000
Koro-Q.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:05:59.250
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:05.170
"Fukuma Tower, 4th Floor"

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:05.260
How long are you going to stay hidden, hmm?

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:08.630
You can't win if you don't attack, kids!

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:08.630
"The Taka Gang's Fukuma Triple Threat:
Gastro the Fiend"

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:11.930
Damn! We can't get anywhere near him!

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:14.260
There's nowhere left to hide!

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:15.980
Then hide behind me!

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:19.560
Eh? Behind you? Um, no thanks...

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:21.690
Ha! I see you!

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:23.110
Ah!

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:29.110
Rats! I guess this is it!

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:38.040
"Bug: All long-range shots
hit the target between the legs"

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.330
I hit him, right?

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:38.580
Wow. And at this distance.

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:39.830
Respect.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:41.250
Thanks.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:45.130
--What's this got to do with the rescue party?
--What's this got to do with the rescue party?

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:48.720
"Fukuma Tower, Top Floor"

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:54.810
Good job beating the Triple Threat
and making it this far!

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:57.310
<i>I</i> am the ringleader of--

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:56.640
"The Taka Gang Ringleader:
Takaoka the Merciless"

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:58.560
I hit him, right?

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:01.440
"Bug: No matter where she aims,
all shots hit the target between the legs"

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:01.850
Figures. No matter the target, you hit it.

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:03.310
Respect.

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:04.730
Thanks.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.440
Man, they're just going nuts.

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.950
Dammit! Ah, but don't forget:

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:13.620
--I still have a hostage!
--Sorry, pal--I got that hostage back!

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:15.580
What? When?!

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:18.660
Sooo yummy!

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.210
What, the <i>pudding</i>?!

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:23.830
Don't you care
what happens to your friend here?

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:31.510
Something already <i>has</i> happened to him!

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:35.260
He's all cute and stuff!

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:37.890
Oooh, nice. These'll fetch a good price.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.390
Stop that, Nakamura!

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:42.060
So you've finally
made up your mind, eh, Nagisa?

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:43.400
Let's get that cut off, hmm?

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:44.940
I'm not cutting <i>anything</i> off!

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:49.070
Nagisa, cross-dressing too perfectly
won't get you laughs.

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:50.570
What kind of advice is that?

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:51.820
--Ooh! Just like that! Yes! Smile for me!
--It's okay, Nagisa. You're so pretty!
Smile for the camera, now.

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:56.080
--Huh? Does... this count as rescuing him?
--Ooh! Just like that! Yes! Smile for me!
--It's okay, Nagisa. You're so pretty! Smile for the camera, now.

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:58.540
You've done well to make it this far!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:00.870
But I still have some tricks up my sleeve!

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:02.670
Yummy! So yummy!

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.250
Kayano!

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:08.630
Fooled you!

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:10.760
That pudding contained a poison

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:14.090
that'll make her sleep forever
without a princess's kiss!

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:17.760
Dammit... what do we do now?

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:20.680
It's not like there's a princess here...

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.640
Sure there is.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:27.690
It won't work! For one thing, I'm a <i>boy</i>!

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:31.740
But you're the most
princess-y one around, Princess Nagisa!

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:33.450
And I've never kissed anyone before!

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:37.450
Come on, can you live with
Kayano never waking up again?

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.540
Well, no, but...

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:45.420
Kiss her! Kiss her! Kiss her!

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:47.330
All right. I'll do it...

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:49.210
...to save Kayano!

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.880
"Nagisa gathered up his courage
and stepped forward"

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:52.050
Huh?

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:57.550
Mwah!

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:08.650
Huh? Why... why am I...

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:11.820
Kayano! Thank goodness!

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:17.870
M-My body... it's so hot...

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:19.370
--Kayano?
--Is it love?

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:21.660
No! This is...

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:26.830
What on earth?!

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:28.580
It can't be!

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:31.090
Who's <i>that</i>?!

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:32.500
"Nagisa's bug turned Kaede into the Big Bad!"

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:32.670
So <i>that</i> happened.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:34.630
What's <i>this</i> creepy thing?

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:37.720
"Creepy"?! You big meanie!

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:45.810
All's well that rends well? Not bad.

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:52.520
It collapsed.

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:54.230
It did.

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:55.570
Respect.

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:56.990
Thanks.

00:09:58.280 --> 00:09:59.700
--Thanks.
--Thanks.
